const demoTitles={sql:'SQL：从一张表到查询结果',permissions:'Linux：755 权限是怎样算出来的',index:'索引思维：顺序查找与二分查找',balance:'负载均衡：请求如何轮流分配',scheduler:'K8s：先筛选节点，再选择候选'};
const demoState={type:'sql',step:0,status:'active',limit:2,target:28,permission:{owner:7,group:5,other:5},identity:'owner',cpu:2,memory:2,disabled:false};let demoTimer=null;
function demoForLesson(c){if(c.title.includes('权限'))return 'permissions';if(c.title.includes('执行计划'))return 'index';if(c.stage===4)return 'sql';if(c.stage===7)return c.title.includes('Service')?'balance':'scheduler';return null;}
function pauseDemo(){if(demoTimer){clearInterval(demoTimer);demoTimer=null;}}
function searchTrace(){const arr=[2,5,9,13,18,23,28,34,39,45,52,60],trace=[];let lo=0,hi=arr.length-1;while(lo<=hi){const mid=Math.floor((lo+hi)/2),found=arr[mid]===demoState.target;trace.push({lo,hi,mid,found,text:found?`中间值 ${arr[mid]} 等于目标 ${demoState.target}，找到记录。`:arr[mid]<demoState.target?`中间值 ${arr[mid]} 小于目标 ${demoState.target}，下一轮只看右半边。`:`中间值 ${arr[mid]} 大于目标 ${demoState.target}，下一轮只看左半边。`});if(found)break;if(arr[mid]<demoState.target)lo=mid+1;else hi=mid-1;}return {arr,trace,found:trace.at(-1)?.found};}
function demoMax(){return demoState.type==='sql'?3:demoState.type==='index'?searchTrace().trace.length:demoState.type==='balance'?9:demoState.type==='scheduler'?3:0;}
function handleDemo(action){if(action==='next'){pauseDemo();demoState.step=Math.min(demoMax(),demoState.step+1);}if(action==='prev'){pauseDemo();demoState.step=Math.max(0,demoState.step-1);}if(action==='reset'){pauseDemo();demoState.step=0;}if(action==='play'){if(demoTimer){pauseDemo();render();return;}if(demoState.step>=demoMax())demoState.step=0;demoTimer=setInterval(()=>{if(view!=='demos'){pauseDemo();return;}demoState.step=Math.min(demoMax(),demoState.step+1);if(demoState.step>=demoMax())pauseDemo();render();},1400);}render();}
function changeDemo(el){pauseDemo();if(el.id==='demo-type'){demoState.type=el.value;demoState.step=0;}if(el.id==='demo-status')demoState.status=el.value;if(el.id==='demo-limit')demoState.limit=Number(el.value);if(el.id==='demo-target')demoState.target=Number(el.value);if(el.id==='demo-cpu')demoState.cpu=Number(el.value);if(el.id==='demo-memory')demoState.memory=Number(el.value);if(el.id==='demo-disabled')demoState.disabled=el.checked;if(el.id==='demo-identity')demoState.identity=el.value;if(el.id.startsWith('demo-perm-')){const parts=el.id.split('-'),bit=Number(parts[3]),key=parts[2];demoState.permission[key]=el.checked?demoState.permission[key]|bit:demoState.permission[key]&~bit;}if(!el.id.startsWith('demo-perm-')&&el.id!=='demo-identity')demoState.step=0;render();}
function demoControls(){const max=demoMax();return max?`<div class="demo-controls"><div class="demo-playback"><button class="secondary" data-action="demo-control" data-control="prev" ${demoState.step===0?'disabled':''}>上一步</button><button class="primary" data-action="demo-control" data-control="next" ${demoState.step===max?'disabled':''}>下一步</button><button class="text-button" data-action="demo-control" data-control="play">${demoTimer?'暂停':'自动演示'}</button><button class="text-button" data-action="demo-control" data-control="reset">重头看</button></div><span>${demoState.step} / ${max} 步</span></div>`:'';}
function permissionDemo(){const p=demoState.permission,digits=`${p.owner}${p.group}${p.other}`,names={owner:'文件属主',group:'所属用户组',other:'其他用户'},chars=n=>[4,2,1].map((b,i)=>n&b?'rwx'[i]:'-').join('');return `<div class="demo-lead"><h2>权限不是暗号，是三个数字的组合。</h2><p>读 = 4，写 = 2，执行 = 1。把允许的权限加起来，就是这一组的数字。</p></div><div class="permission-grid">${Object.entries(p).map(([k,n])=>`<section class="permission-card"><span class="eyebrow">${names[k]}</span><strong class="permission-digit">${n}</strong><code>${chars(n)}</code><div class="permission-checks">${[[4,'读 r'],[2,'写 w'],[1,'执行 x']].map(([bit,t])=>`<label><input id="demo-perm-${k}-${bit}" type="checkbox" ${n&bit?'checked':''}>${t} <small>+${bit}</small></label>`).join('')}</div><p>${[4,2,1].filter(b=>n&b).join(' + ')||'0'} = ${n}</p></section>`).join('')}</div><div class="demo-result"><span>组合之后的命令</span><code>chmod ${digits} health.sh</code><p>权限显示：-${chars(p.owner)}${chars(p.group)}${chars(p.other)}</p></div><div class="demo-inputs"><label>以谁的身份查看<select id="demo-identity">${Object.entries(names).map(([k,t])=>`<option value="${k}" ${demoState.identity===k?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div><div class="explain-panel"><strong>${names[demoState.identity]}在当前设置下：</strong><p>${[4,2,1].map((bit,i)=>`${p[demoState.identity]&bit?'可以':'不能'}${['读取','写入','执行'][i]}`).join(' · ')}</p></div><p class="demo-footnote">这里演示普通文件的基本权限位。真实判断还需结合属主、组、ACL、路径上的目录权限及安全策略；目录的 x 表示可进入和访问，不是运行目录。</p>`;}
function sqlDemo(){const data=[{id:1,name:'Alice',status:'active'},{id:2,name:'Bob',status:'inactive'},{id:3,name:'Carol',status:'active'},{id:4,name:'Dave',status:'active'},{id:5,name:'Eve',status:'inactive'}],match=r=>demoState.status==='all'||r.status===demoState.status;let rows=data.map(r=>({...r}));const filtered=rows.filter(match);if(demoState.step>=2)rows.sort((a,b)=>b.id-a.id);if(demoState.step===3)rows=filtered.sort((a,b)=>b.id-a.id).slice(0,demoState.limit);const names=['读取 users 表','按 WHERE 条件筛选','按 id 降序排列','取前 LIMIT 条结果'],step=demoState.step;return `<div class="demo-lead"><h2>一条查询，分几步得到结果。</h2><p>选择条件，然后点“下一步”。观察哪些记录被保留，顺序和数量又怎样变化。</p></div><div class="demo-inputs"><label>用户状态<select id="demo-status">${[['active','启用 active'],['inactive','停用 inactive'],['all','全部，不设 WHERE']].map(([v,t])=>`<option value="${v}" ${demoState.status===v?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>最多返回<select id="demo-limit">${[1,2,3,5].map(n=>`<option ${demoState.limit===n?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div><pre class="demo-query">SELECT id, name, status FROM users${demoState.status==='all'?'':"\nWHERE status = '"+demoState.status+"'"}\nORDER BY id DESC\nLIMIT ${demoState.limit};</pre><div class="algorithm-stages">${names.map((n,i)=>`<div class="${i===step?'active':i<step?'done':''}"><span>${i+1}</span><strong>${n}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="data-table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><caption>${names[step]} · ${step===0?5:step===3?rows.length:filtered.length} 条有效记录</caption><thead><tr><th>id</th><th>name</th><th>status</th><th>此时的结果</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr class="${step>=1&&!match(r)?'filtered-out':'retained'}"><td>${r.id}</td><td>${r.name}</td><td><span class="status-text">${r.status}</span></td><td>${step===0?'等待筛选':match(r)?'保留':'不符合条件'}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="explain-panel" aria-live="polite"><strong>${names[step]}</strong><p>${['先从 users 表读出候选记录。','不满足 WHERE 条件的记录变淡；筛选改变记录数量，但还没有排序。','把保留记录按 id 从大到小排列；这一步主要改变顺序。',`最终只返回前 ${demoState.limit} 条符合条件的记录。`][step]}</p></div><p class="demo-footnote">这是 SELECT 的概念处理顺序示意。真实数据库的优化器可能改变物理执行路径，索引也可能影响读取和排序方式。</p>`;}
function indexDemo(){const {arr,trace,found}=searchTrace(),step=demoState.step,t=step?trace[step-1]:null,scan=arr.includes(demoState.target)?arr.indexOf(demoState.target)+1:arr.length;return `<div class="demo-lead"><h2>数据有顺序，就能减少比较次数。</h2><p>用有序数组演示二分查找：每次比较中间值，排除一半候选范围。</p></div><div class="demo-inputs"><label>要找的编号<select id="demo-target">${[2,18,28,52,60,27].map(n=>`<option ${demoState.target===n?'selected':''}>${n}${n===27?'（不存在）':''}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div><div class="search-cells">${arr.map((v,i)=>`<div class="search-cell ${t&&i===t.mid?'probe':t&&(i<t.lo||i>t.hi)?'excluded':'candidate'}"><small>位置 ${i+1}</small><strong>${v}</strong>${t&&i===t.mid?'<span>本次比较</span>':'<span> </span>'}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="search-legend"><span>蓝色：本次比较</span><span>浅色：候选范围</span><span>灰色：已排除</span></div><div class="comparison"><div><span>从头顺序查找</span><strong>${scan}<small> 次比较</small></strong></div><div><span>本次二分查找</span><strong>${step}<small> / ${trace.length} 次比较</small></strong></div></div><div class="explain-panel" aria-live="polite"><strong>${step?'第 '+step+' 次比较':'先确认数据有序'}</strong><p>${t?t.text:'二分查找依赖有序数据。首先在整个区间内选择中间位置。'}${step===trace.length&&!found?' 下一轮候选区间为空，确认没有该编号。':''}</p></div><p class="demo-footnote">以 MySQL InnoDB 为例，常见索引使用 B+ 树结构，不能等同于这个数组模型。这里用二分查找帮助理解“利用有序结构缩小查找范围”；实际查询是否使用索引，应通过 EXPLAIN 验证。顺序查找通常为 O(n)，二分查找为 O(log n)。</p>`;}
function balanceDemo(){const count=demoState.step;return `<div class="demo-lead"><h2>轮询：把请求一个个轮流分出去。</h2><p>每点一次“下一步”，发送一个请求。调度顺序是 A、B、C，然后回到 A。</p></div><div class="request-ticket"><span>模拟请求</span><strong>${count?'第 '+count+' 个请求':'等待第一个请求'}</strong><p>${count?'本次分配给服务 '+['A','B','C'][(count-1)%3]:'从服务 A 开始轮流分配'}</p></div><div class="server-grid">${['A','B','C'].map((n,i)=>{const received=Math.floor(count/3)+(i<count%3?1:0),active=count>0&&(count-1)%3===i;return `<section class="server-card ${active?'active':''}"><span class="server-label">服务 ${n}</span><strong>${received}<small> 个请求</small></strong><div class="request-blocks">${Array.from({length:received},(_,j)=>`<span title="已收到请求 ${j*3+i+1}">${j*3+i+1}</span>`).join('')}</div><p>${active?'正在接收本次请求':'等待轮到自己'}</p></section>`;}).join('')}</div><div class="explain-panel"><strong>轮询让请求数量相对均匀</strong><p>每次向下一个后端发送请求，不根据请求耗时或服务器实际压力决定。</p></div><p class="demo-footnote">这是等权重、健康后端的理想轮询模型。真实负载均衡还可能使用权重、健康检查、最少连接或其他策略。K8s Service 的实际数据转发方式取决于代理或数据平面实现，不能一概当成这里的轮询。</p>`;}
function schedulerModel(){const need={cpu:demoState.cpu,memory:demoState.memory},nodes=[{name:'node-a',cpu:4,memory:4,disabled:false},{name:'node-b',cpu:2,memory:8,disabled:demoState.disabled},{name:'node-c',cpu:1,memory:2,disabled:false}];for(const n of nodes){n.fit=!n.disabled&&n.cpu>=need.cpu&&n.memory>=need.memory;n.score=n.fit?n.cpu-need.cpu:-1;n.reason=n.disabled?'节点被设置为不可调度':n.cpu<need.cpu?'CPU 可分配量不足':n.memory<need.memory?'内存可分配量不足':'满足请求，可以进入候选';}const winner=nodes.filter(n=>n.fit).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score)[0];return {nodes,winner,need};}
function schedulerDemo(){const {nodes,winner,need}=schedulerModel(),step=demoState.step;return `<div class="demo-lead"><h2>把一个 Pod 放在哪里？先筛选，再选择。</h2><p>改变 Pod 请求的资源，观察候选节点变化。这里用“剩余 CPU 越多分数越高”的教学规则选择节点。</p></div><div class="demo-inputs"><label>Pod CPU 请求<select id="demo-cpu">${[1,2,3,5].map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${need.cpu===n?'selected':''}>${n} 核</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Pod 内存请求<select id="demo-memory">${[1,2,4,6].map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${need.memory===n?'selected':''}>${n} GiB</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="check-input"><input id="demo-disabled" type="checkbox" ${demoState.disabled?'checked':''}>禁止调度到 node-b</label></div><div class="algorithm-stages"><div class="${step===0?'active':step>0?'done':''}"><span>1</span><strong>读取 Pod 请求</strong></div><div class="${step===1?'active':step>1?'done':''}"><span>2</span><strong>筛选可用节点</strong></div><div class="${step===2?'active':step>2?'done':''}"><span>3</span><strong>给候选打分</strong></div><div class="${step===3?'active':''}"><span>4</span><strong>选择并绑定</strong></div></div><div class="scheduler-nodes">${nodes.map(n=>`<section class="node-card ${step>=1&&!n.fit?'rejected':''} ${step===3&&winner?.name===n.name?'chosen':''}"><div class="node-title"><strong>${n.name}</strong><span>${step>=1?(n.fit?'候选':'排除'):'待评估'}</span></div><div class="resource"><span>可用 CPU</span><strong>${n.cpu} 核</strong><div><i style="width:${n.cpu/4*100}%"></i></div></div><div class="resource"><span>可用内存</span><strong>${n.memory} GiB</strong><div><i style="width:${n.memory/8*100}%"></i></div></div><p>${step>=1?n.reason:'本演示只看资源请求和不可调度标记。'}</p>${step>=2&&n.fit?`<div class="node-score">教学分数：${n.score}（剩余 CPU）</div>`:''}${step===3&&winner?.name===n.name?'<div class="bound-pod">✓ Pod 选择这个节点</div>':''}</section>`).join('')}</div><div class="explain-panel" aria-live="polite"><strong>${['先读取资源请求','排除不满足条件的节点','比较候选教学分数','模拟调度结果'][step]}</strong><p>${step===0?`Pod 请求 ${need.cpu} 核 CPU 和 ${need.memory} GiB 内存。`:step===1?'资源不足或被设为不可调度的节点变淡。':step===2?'在剩余候选中，用教学分数比较。真实调度器会使用配置的多个插件和策略。':winner?`按当前教学规则选中 ${winner.name}。真实环境后续还需拉取镜像、启动容器并通过探针。`:'没有节点满足请求，Pod 仍然 Pending。应检查资源和约束，不能只反复重启。'}</p></div><p class="demo-footnote">简化范围：仅演示资源筛选与单一打分规则，忽略亲和性、污点、拓扑、存储等约束；不等于 K8s 默认调度策略。调度依据资源 requests，而不是只看实时 CPU 使用率。</p>`;}
function demosPage(){const title=demoTitles[demoState.type];return `<main class="page demos-page"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">把看不见的过程，拆开来看</div><h1>原理，用眼睛也能学。</h1><p>调一调条件，逐步执行。观察变化，再回到课程里练习。</p></div><button class="secondary" data-action="view" data-view="classroom">回到当前课程</button></div><div class="demo-selector"><label for="demo-type">选择演示</label><select id="demo-type">${Object.entries(demoTitles).map(([k,t])=>`<option value="${k}" ${k===demoState.type?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}</select><span>可交互 · 可暂停 · 可重看</span></div><section class="demo-canvas" aria-label="${esc(title)}">${isNetworkDemo()?renderNetworkDemo():demoState.type==='permissions'?permissionDemo():demoState.type==='sql'?sqlDemo():demoState.type==='index'?indexDemo():demoState.type==='balance'?balanceDemo():schedulerDemo()}${demoControls()}<div class="demo-sources">${demoState.type==='scheduler'?'<a href="https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/scheduling-eviction/kube-scheduler/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 K8s 官方调度说明</a>':demoState.type==='index'||demoState.type==='sql'?'<a href="https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/optimization-indexes.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 MySQL 官方索引说明</a>':demoState.type==='permissions'?'<a href="https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/coreutils.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 GNU 官方权限说明</a>':''}</div></section><div class="footer-note">先看懂过程，再练命令。这里的数值和对象为教学样本；每个演示都注明了与真实系统的差异。</div></main>`;}
